  message: "Done in PR #1836 (dev 09525e1fd2), owner ruling 2026-10-24 (narrow + amend the table). Ruling 3 read literally flags correct ids (grpc census: 18 real 1-1 spans, 1,904 C++ include targets named file, 7 angle headers), so the table's reading was amended in ADR-0036 and two rules are enforced. (1) The file pseudo-symbol (name and kind 'file') has span 1-1, at error: 0 hits on grpc, whisper.cpp, sherpa-onnx. (2) No <unknown> path slot, at warning until WI-zihij's producers are fixed: grpc 221, whisper.cpp 361. LIVE on merged dev: hypergumbo run on a 2-file repo (CMakeLists.txt with target_link_libraries(app ${SOME_LIB}) + main.c) gives rc=0, and validation_report carries one warning for cmake:<unknown>:0-0:${SOME_LIB}:external_symbol. Both file nodes are 1-1:file:file, with no triple violation."  # f841
